            <div class="p-4 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm">
              <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 mb-2">Level 3</span>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Tertiary Structure (3°)</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Overall three-dimensional globular or fibrous conformation of a single polypeptide chain driven by side-chain (R-group) interactions.</p>
